ACADEMIC PERFORMANCE PREDICTION SYSTEM
README


1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
The Academic Performance Prediction system is a python-based machine learning project that predicts a student's academic performance.


The system contains attendance percentage, average study hours, previous exam marks, assignment completion percentage, and internal marks to develop a Logical model. Using the model, we can predict whether a student tends to be GOOD or NEEDS IMPROVEMENT based on the given input features.


2. OBJECTIVES
- Predict student's academic performance using a machine learning algorithm
- Study and analyze various academic and study-related features
- Keep records of students who needs improvement in academics
- Provide suggestions based on the given input


- Showcasing Python and Scikit learn implementation


3.TECHNOLOGIES USED
- Python
- Scikit-learn
- Logistic Regression
- Machine Learning


4. INPUT PARAMETERS
- Attendance Percentage
- Average Study Hours
- Previous Exam Marks Percentage
- Assignment Completion Percentage
- Internal Marks Percentage


