6. PREDICTION RESULTS
The system provides one of the following predictions:
- GOOD: Student is likely to be performing well in academics
- NEEDS IMPROVEMENT: Student is likely to be performing poor in academics
The system will also display the prediction confidence and suggestions


7. INSTALLATION
Install the required library using
pip install scikit-learn
8. HOW TO RUN
Run the python file using
